Rewrote the Sign In story as a Background ("Given a customer is not signed
in") plus separate Scenarios, one per actual resume gate traced from code:
  - onboarding already complete -> gate is customer.billing.id existing
    (not metadata.verified) -> Then ... taken to their Dashboard
  - no plan selected yet -> Then ... taken back to Select Plan
  - plan selected but no phone number chosen -> Then ... taken back to
    Pick Number
  - phone number chosen but no SIM type selected -> Then ... taken back
    to Select SIM
  - SIM selected but identity not verified -> Then ... taken back to
    Profile & KYC
  - identity verified but checkout not completed -> Then ... taken back
    to Checkout & Pay
  - checkout done but result not yet seen -> Then ... taken back to View
    Order Result
No Given cites metadata.verified for this decision anymore; outcomes are
plain English naming the story being resumed, no literal route paths.